        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000271"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A facial appearance characteristic of myopathic conditions. The face appears expressionless with sunken cheeks, bilateral ptosis, and inability to elevate the corners of the mouth, due to muscle weakness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
