        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Footdrop</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Inability to heel walk</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Inability to walk on heels</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0009027</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Dorsiflexion of the foot extends the foot superiorly, as if taking the foot off the gas pedal.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Foot dorsiflexor weakness</rdfs:label>
